	__models__GongNoteShape__00000007_.Name = `08. RunwayDirection, CentrelinePoint & DeclaredDistance-Note08RunwayDirection`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000007_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note08RunwayDirection`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000007_.Body = `08. RunwayDirection, CentrelinePoint & DeclaredDistance Story

Eachlanding/take-off orientation of a runway is a [models.RunwayDirectionTimeSliceType] (e.g. 09L / 27R).
Thresholds and stop-ends are [models.RunwayCentrelinePointTimeSliceType] points publishing TORA, TODA, ASDA, and LDA in [models.RunwayDeclaredDistanceType] and [models.RunwayDeclaredDistanceValueType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000007_.BodyHTML = `<p>08. RunwayDirection, CentrelinePoint &amp; DeclaredDistance Story
<p>Eachlanding/take-off orientation of a runway is a <a href="/models#RunwayDirectionTimeSliceType">models.RunwayDirectionTimeSliceType</a> (e.g. 09L / 27R).
Thresholds and stop-ends are <a href="/models#RunwayCentrelinePointTimeSliceType">models.RunwayCentrelinePointTimeSliceType</a> points publishing TORA, TODA, ASDA, and LDA in <a href="/models#RunwayDeclaredDistanceType">models.RunwayDeclaredDistanceType</a> and <a href="/models#RunwayDeclaredDistanceValueType">models.RunwayDeclaredDistanceValueType</a>.
`
