	__models__GongNoteShape__00000009_.Body = `10. Taxiway, TaxiwayElement, HoldingPosition & GuidanceLine Story

Movement paths between runways and aprons use [models.TaxiwayTimeSliceType], [models.TaxiwayElementTimeSliceType], and [models.GuidanceLineTimeSliceType],
protected by runway-incursion [models.TaxiHoldingPositionTimeSliceType] bars and [models.ManoeuvringAreaAvailabilityType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000009_.BodyHTML = `<p>10. Taxiway, TaxiwayElement, HoldingPosition &amp; GuidanceLine Story
<p>Movement paths between runways and aprons use <a href="/models#TaxiwayTimeSliceType">models.TaxiwayTimeSliceType</a>, <a href="/models#TaxiwayElementTimeSliceType">models.TaxiwayElementTimeSliceType</a>, and <a href="/models#GuidanceLineTimeSliceType">models.GuidanceLineTimeSliceType</a>,
protected by runway-incursion <a href="/models#TaxiHoldingPositionTimeSliceType">models.TaxiHoldingPositionTimeSliceType</a> bars and <a href="/models#ManoeuvringAreaAvailabilityType">models.ManoeuvringAreaAvailabilityType</a>.
`
